 186:LUFA/Drivers/USB/HighLevel/../LowLevel/Device.h **** 			 *  \return Size in bytes of the descriptor if it exists, zero or \ref NO_DESCRIPTOR otherwise.
 187:LUFA/Drivers/USB/HighLevel/../LowLevel/Device.h **** 			 */
